  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "應用數理統計學(一)實習",
    "sub_ename": "RECITATION OF APPLIED MATHEMATICAL STATISTICS (1)",
    "describe_ch": "本實習課程是在輔助應用數理統計學實習(一)，並藉由習作與演算，?學生了解正確的統計運算。本課程研討統計理論，以建立其他統計課程基礎，使學生在統計之理論上有較深一層之瞭解，使期能更正確的運用統計方法。主題包括：機率論、機率空間、隨機變數分配與函數、離散型機率分配、連續型機率分配和特徵函數強調該統計分析方法在解決實際問題中的作用而對其方法原理，理論僅做概要性的介紹。",
    "describe_eh": "This recitation class of Applied Mathematical Statistics (I) discusses questions in lectures and homework assignments. Content covers probability theory, probability spaces, distributions of random variables, distribution functions of random variables, discrete probability distributions, continuous probability distribution, and moment generating functions, independence of random variables, and transformation of random variables.",
    "pre_subname": "MATH1001微積分(一)、MATH1002微積分(二)",
    "pre_sub_id3": "MATH1001",
    "pre_sub_ename": "MATH1001 CALCULUS(1)、MATH1002 CALCULUS(2)",
